          "attachment_identity": "python:The-Interdependency/skill-lib:tools/build_codex_plugin_skills.py::<module>",
          "description": "Usage guidance:\n    python tools/build_codex_plugin_skills.py --check\n    python tools/build_codex_plugin_skills.py --apply\n\nCanonical skill doctrine remains in ``<skill-name>/SKILL.md``. Generated files\nunder ``skills/`` contain only discovery metadata and an instruction to load\nthat canonical source. Do not edit generated adapters by hand.",
