          "attachment_identity": "python:The-Interdependency/skill-lib:tools/check_skill_compliance.py::<module>",
          "description": "This checker intentionally enforces only repo-wide invariants that are already\ncanon in AGENTS.md and skill-build/SKILL.md. It reports softer section-shape\nrecommendations as warnings so historical skills can be normalized family by\nfamily without doctrinal churn.",
